Features: Spring Boot 3.3.4, Java 21, JSP, PostgreSQL + H2, WebJars, DevTools.
Setup Instructions:

Clone repo
Configure PostgreSQL & H2 in application.properties


Build & Run:
Shell
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run


JSP Setup: Place JSP files in src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/jsp/
WebJars Usage: Bootstrap & jQuery integration examples.
Testing: mvn test
